by a player -> permission_denied: only the campaign's master can do this
a bad key -> invalid_argument: idempotency_key must be a UUID
0 seconds -> invalid_argument: seconds must be 1 to 86400
-1 second -> invalid_argument: seconds must be 1 to 86400
a day and a second -> invalid_argument: seconds must be 1 to 86400
a bad key and 0 seconds -> invalid_argument: idempotency_key must be a UUID
before:
spell:bless kind=spell dur=rounds left=60 mods=[] conds=[] visible=true
spell:guidance kind=spell dur=rounds left=60 mods=[] conds=[] visible=true
spell:bless kind=spell dur=rounds left=600 mods=[] conds=[] visible=true
spell:longstrider kind=spell dur=rounds left=86400 mods=[] conds=[] visible=true

a minute, call 1 -> ended 2
spell:bless kind=spell dur=rounds left=540 mods=[] conds=[] visible=true
spell:longstrider kind=spell dur=rounds left=86340 mods=[] conds=[] visible=true

a minute, call 2 -> ended 2
spell:bless kind=spell dur=rounds left=540 mods=[] conds=[] visible=true
spell:longstrider kind=spell dur=rounds left=86340 mods=[] conds=[] visible=true

the same key for 61 seconds -> invalid_argument: idempotency_key was already used for another change
a key with no hyphens -> no error
the same key written with hyphens -> no error
a combat running -> failed_precondition: a combat is running: finish it before resting
the combat ended, a day -> ended 2
after a day:

events:
game_time_advanced {"ended":2,"seconds":60}
game_time_advanced {"ended":0,"seconds":6}
game_time_advanced {"ended":2,"seconds":86400}

no session open -> failed_precondition: the campaign has no open game session
